      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUMMER ANGEL (3) hit the ground running from out wide with a scorching early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 2 length fifth (24.83) over 440m at Goulburn. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Tough to beat if on-song. ASHBY MOCHA (2) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths (20.81) behind Hey Aldo at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. PRINCESS ADA (4) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 0.8 lengths from the winner Irinka Brett (30.03) at Wentworth Park. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Can measure up. OUT EXPRESS (1) placed last time at this track and distance - worth some thought.",
